  "details": "Instead of \"VRChat for Quest\", the build alert should refer to mobile platforms.\n\nSteps to reproduce:\n\n1. Add any avatar that's VeryPoor on mobile platforms.\n\n2. Switch the builder to Android or iOS.\n\n3. Check the builder alerts and notice the VeryPoor performance estimate alert.\n\nActual text: Overall Performance Estimate: VeryPoor - This avatar does not meet the minimum performance requirements for VRChat. It will be blocked by default on VRChat for Quest, and will not show unless a user chooses to show your avatar. [...]\n\nExpected text: Overall Performance Estimate: VeryPoor - This avatar does not meet the minimum performance requirements for VRChat. It will be blocked by default on standalone VR and mobile platforms, and will not show unless a user chooses to show your avatar. [...]\n\nVRChat SDK - Avatars 3.10.6.",
